  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.ConsciousnessTransfer.Description>将当前机体的自主意识转移到其他能承载自主意识的机体中。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.ConsciousnessTransfer.Description>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.ConsciousnessTransfer.NoCandidate>没有可承载意识的机体。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.ConsciousnessTransfer.NoCandidate>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.ConsciousnessTransfer.Failed>意识转移失败。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.ConsciousnessTransfer.Failed>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.ConsciousnessTransfer.RecoveringEmergencyData>正在恢复损失的意识数据</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.ConsciousnessTransfer.RecoveringEmergencyData>

  <!-- 模块：控制权交接（轨道数据网络研究完成后） -->
