  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.DormantActivation.EmergencyCarry.Label>承载紧急意识转移</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.DormantActivation.EmergencyCarry.Label>
  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.DormantActivation.EmergencyCarry.Description>将这台尚未启动的「正义」指定为紧急意识转移的优先承载机体。当当前机械意识宿主即将被摧毁时，它会立即启动并接收机械意识。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.Justice.DormantActivation.EmergencyCarry.Description>

